  "solution": {
    "text": "<br/><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_advanced/image3-32f9cc38-ea48-406f-8a31-87dbb0f2805d.jpg\"/> <br > <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">λ</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1242</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>90</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>13.8</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"> </mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></math> <br > <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>∆</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mo>+</mo><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mo>.</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mo>.</mo><mo>)</mo></math> <br > <math><mn>13.8</mn><mo>=</mo><mo>∆</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>10.4</mn></math> <br > <math><mo>∆</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3.4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"> </mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></math> <br >So electron initially was in  <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math>",
